{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id24255046"}, "name":{"label":"Dwadel"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-29T05:10:31-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.28.0"}, "id":{"label":"14009017547"}, "title":{"label":"Wonky"}, "content":{"label":"Sometimes the result is good, but too many times the AI doesn’t pay attention. I click the button for a male vocal and it gives me a female. I will even add “male vocal” to the style and the AI ignores it. Sometimes I get a duet on a song with a clear singular point of view. Any annoyance is that the AI mispronounces lyrics all the time. The song will be going great with a good melody and a solid hook and then it mushes lines or uses the wrong words and you can’t just fix that part without destroying other parts. I have to generate so many versions burning through credits to get one that’s mostly good. It can be very frustrating. When it works, it can be great, but I feel like the more I use it, the dumber the AI is getting.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6677033144&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
